From: =?UTF-8?q?Miroslav=20Mr=C3=A1z?= <miroslav.mraz@techmania.cz>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:35:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH v1 3/3] Input: stmfts_fts5cu56a - clean up coding style
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Cosmetic-only cleanup of the imported downstream driver: wrap lines over
100 columns, rename CamelCase locals and command buffers to snake_case,
rename the sysfs show callbacks to <attr>_show and use DEVICE_ATTR_RO(),
use max_t() for the u8 comparisons, drop unnecessary braces, reformat the
banner and kernel-doc block comments, remove commented-out dead code and
switch MODULE_LICENSE() to "GPL". No functional change.

Signed-off-by: Miroslav Mráz <miroslav.mraz@techmania.cz>
---
 drivers/input/touchscreen/stmfts_fts5cu56a.c | 389 +++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 194 insertions(+), 195 deletions(-)

